# Controls reference
help.title=Spellcross Reloaded controls
help.general=Menus and display
help.key.fullscreen=Alt+Enter
help.action.fullscreen=Switch between fullscreen and windowed mode on all three game screens.
help.key.menu=Mouse / arrows
help.action.menu=Click a menu item to open it. Use arrows and Enter to choose, Escape to close.
help.mouse=Tactical map — mouse
help.key.left=Left button
help.action.left=Select a unit, move or attack according to the clicked location. Choose an action if several are available.
help.key.box_select=Hold left button
help.action.box_select=Drag over allied units to create a temporary movement group. Drag-select is enabled by default and can be disabled in Options. Numbered groups are not changed.
help.key.drag=Hold right button
help.action.drag=Drag the mouse to scroll the battlefield.
help.key.wheel=Mouse wheel
help.action.wheel=Zoom the map around the cursor. Up zooms in, down zooms out (50–300%).
help.key.info=Info + left click
help.action.info=Click the HUD Info button, then a visible unit to inspect its statistics. Escape cancels inspection.
help.keys=Tactical map — keyboard
help.key.pan_arrows=Arrow keys
help.action.pan_arrows=Hold to scroll the battlefield, including diagonally. Available during deployment.
help.key.space=Space
help.action.space=Cycle the normal, movement-range and attack-range views.
help.key.ranges=Hold M / A
help.action.ranges=Temporarily show movement range (M) or attack range (A). Release the key to restore the previous view.
help.key.escape=Escape
help.action.escape=Close an open tactical overlay or cancel the active group. Otherwise open the main menu.
help.key.enter=Enter
help.action.enter=Confirm initial deployment once all companies have been placed.
help.key.tactical_save=Ctrl+Shift+S / Ctrl+Shift+L
help.action.tactical_save=Save (S) or load (L) a tactical game.
help.groups=Tactical map — unit groups
help.key.groups=1–8
help.action.groups=Activate a group. Press the same number again to deselect it.
help.key.group_mouse=Left / Shift+left
help.action.group_mouse=With a group active, click a friendly unit to add or remove it. Shift selects the air unit on a stacked tile.
help.key.all=Alt+A
help.action.all=Add all living allied units to the active group.
help.strategic=Strategic map
help.key.strategic_mouse=Left button
help.action.strategic_mouse=Select territories and use the on-screen buttons for missions, research, purchases and unit management.
help.key.strategic_save=Ctrl+S / Ctrl+L
help.action.strategic_save=Save or load a strategic game. On the opening screen, Continue resumes the last automatic exit save.
help.close=Close
